Usage of unlock:
  -all
    	release every lock owned by my uuid
  -expect-holder value
    	owner@epoch (from loto status) this break must find; repeat per holder of a shared target; refuse if the holder set moved
  -force
    	break a lock; BLIND unless --expect-holder names the hold to break
  -intent string
    	intent (required only with --force)
  -only-intent string
    	with --all, release only locks whose recorded intent exactly matches this — scopes the sweep to one lane's own locks when a shared owner id also covers peer lanes (sd-xhap)
  -t string
    	intent (required only with --force)
